---
import { GITHUB_URL } from "../../lib/site";

const tile = "p-[28px_26px]";
const title = "text-[length:var(--text-h4)]";
const body = "mt-2 text-[length:var(--text-sm)] text-ink-soft";
---

<section id="features" class="section section-dim scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Features</p>
      <h2>Built different</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class={tile}>
        <h3 class={title}>Plans that fit your constraints</h3>
        <p class={body}>
          Budget and hours are hard inputs. €400 a month and 4 hours a week gets
          a plan you can actually execute, not an agency fantasy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class={tile}>
        <h3 class={title}>Decisions, not just content</h3>
        <p class={body}>
          Kampa picks 2-3 channels and tells you why it rejected the others. No
          more guessing where to post.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class={tile}>
        <h3 class={title}>Copy in your voice</h3>
        <p class={body}>
          Paste a few of your real posts; every asset is written to sound like
          you, not like AI slop.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class={tile}>
        <h3 class={title}>Live cost meter</h3>
        <p class={body}>
          See tokens and euros as you go. A full campaign costs about €1. Jasper
          charges €69 a month for less.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class={tile}>
        <h3 class={title}>Nothing leaves your browser</h3>
        <p class={body}>
          No account, no server, no database. Your business data and API key
          stay on your machine; the only network call is to Anthropic. The code
          is <a
            href={GITHUB_URL}
            rel="noopener"
            class="text-violet-ink font-medium underline underline-offset-4"
            >open source</a
          > — check it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class={tile}>
        <h3 class={title}>Own your plan</h3>
        <p class={body}>
          Export Markdown, PDF, calendar file. No lock-in, no seat license, no
          vendor.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
